            "content": "<p><strong>Somatic Psychology</strong></p><p><em>Works with the body as a primary entry point for healing. Develops awareness of physical sensation, nervous system states, and the embodied experience of trauma.</em></p>",
            "link_url": "https://traumahealing.org/",
            "link_text": "What is SP?",
            "link_external": true,
            "link_style": "button"
          }
        },
        "item_LMR7bn": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "column_size": "4",
            "title": "EFT",
            "heading_tag": "h4",
            "content": "<p><strong>Emotional Freedom Technique</strong></p><p><em>A somatic-informed approach using acupressure points to reduce emotional distress. Supports nervous system regulation and the release of stored stress responses.</em></p>",
            "link_url": "https://healthy.kaiserpermanente.org/health-wellness/health-encyclopedia/he.emotional-freedom-technique-eft.acl9225",
            "link_text": "What is EFT?",
            "link_external": true,
            "link_style": "button"
          }
        }
      },
